sVWhat is the personal information collected by us and why do we need to collect such information
p16
I1
sVThe statements included herein disclose the privacy practices (\u201cPrivacy Policy\u201d) of JFKSPL at our website https:// www.momspresso.com/ (\u201cWebsite\u201d) and mobile application known as \u201cMomspresso\u201d (\u201cMobile Application\u201d) to help Users to understand what information we collect, how we handle it and what rights the Users have on their information.
p17
I1
sVWe collect information about you and your use of our Services, your interactions with us as well as information regarding your devices used to access our services (such as mobile devices, tablets and other viewing devices):
p18
I1
sVPlease be aware that if you do not allow us to collect personal information from you, we may not be able to deliver certain experiences, products, and services to you, and some of our services may not be able to take account of your interests and preferences.
p19
I1
sVOur Privacy Policy describes how https://www.momspresso.com/ (the \u201cWebsite\u201d) collects and uses information from visitors of our Website and one way we collect such information is through the use of cookies.
p20
I1
sVThe \u201chelp\u201d option of the toolbar in most web browsers will provide information on how to prevent your web browser from accepting new cookies, how to tell your web browser to inform you when you receive a new cookie or how to disable cookies altogether.
p21
I1
sVWe use your information to
p22
I1
sVIf you send us personal correspondence, such as emails or letters, or if other users or third parties send us correspondence about your activities or postings on the Website and/or the Mobile App, we may collect and store such information.
p23
I1
sVIn any case, we will not be liable and/or responsible for our denial of certain services to you for lack of you providing the necessary personal information.
p24
I1
sVJFKSPL may also carefully select other companies to send you information about their products or services which are related to the services but are not necessary to its operation (\u201cExtended Service\u201d).
p25
I1
sVWe collect the following information from the respective social media platforms, including but not limited to public information, name, email ID, friend list, etc.
p26
I1
sVMoreover, if you browse our Website using your web browser\u2019s anonymous visitor setting (called \u201cIncognito\u201d in Chrome, \u201cInPrivate\u201d in Internet Explorer etc.), cookies cannot be set on your device.
p27
I1
sVWe receive and store certain types of information whenever you interact with us via Website or Mobile App through your device or any other electronic device capable of connecting to internet.
p28
I1
sVJFKSPL may disclose personally identifiable information if required to do so by law or in good faith belief that such action is necessary to:
p29
I1
sVWe also use regional and language specific buttons.
p30
I1
sVIn the event, JFKSPL is merged with or acquired by another company or in case of re-organization or re-structuring of business, we and our affiliates may share your personal information, wholly or in part, with another business entity.
p31
I1
sVThese companies may use information about your visits to this and other websites or applications, in order to provide advertisements about goods and services of interest to you.
